X:1
T:Lullaby of Birdland
C:George Shearing, 1952
N:Named after the Birdland jazz club in New York; words by George David Weiss.
N:Melody and chords from Ian Hayden's abc-music-files (github.com/ian-hayden,
N:Jazz songs), checked against an alto sax MIDI on hamienet.com
N:(track 352501780124323). The MIDI fixed the second ending: the source
N:wrote E-flat on beat 1 after a tied F; the MIDI holds the F and puts the
N:E-flat on beat 3. The tie into the last A section is restored the same way.
